 States, is not backed by the United States government, and accounts and value balances are not subject to Federal Deposit Insurance Corporation or Securities Investor Protection Corporation protections.\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"list-item\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"Transactions in virtual currency may be irreversible, and, accordingly, losses due to fraudulent, mistaken or accidental transactions may not be recoverable.  If you believe you did not authorize a particular transaction or that a transaction was incorrectly carried out, you must contact us as soon as possible. Reporting an unauthorized transaction does not guarantee Coinbase will be able to reverse the transaction or reimburse you for the transaction.\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"list-item\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"The nature of virtual currency may lead to an increased risk of fraud or cyber attack.\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"list-item\"}],\"nodeType\":\"unordered-list\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"If you have a complaint, please contact Coinbase, Inc. at 1-888-908-7930 or \",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{\"uri\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fhelp.coinbase.com\u002Fen\u002Fcontact-us\"},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fhelp.coinbase.com\u002Fen\u002Fcontact-us\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"hyperlink\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\". If you still have an unresolved complaint regarding Coinbase, Inc. money transmission activity, you may file it by contacting the Washington Department of Financial Institutions at \",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{\"uri\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fdfi.wa.gov\u002Fconsumers\u002Fmoney-services-complaint\"},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fdfi.wa.gov\u002Fconsumers\u002Fmoney-services-complaint\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"hyperlink\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"document\"},\"sidebarText\":\"Appendix 2: State License Disclosures\"},{\"contentTypeId\":\"CDXV2_EditorialText\",\"id\":\"2NIzwhzT1bDmHL4kV1Zsyg\",\"componentId\":\"business-user-agreement-us-appendix-3-additional-services\",\"body\":{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[],\"nodeType\":\"hr\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"value\":\"APPENDIX 3:  Additional Services \",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"heading-4\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"In addition to the Services described in the Agreement, the following services (\\\"Additional Services\\\") may be made available by Coinbase to Coinbase Business customers that fulfill certain eligibility criteria. The provisions for each Additional Service herein apply to your use of such Additional Service, in addition to the other applicable provisions of the Agreement. If you do not use any Additional Services, then this Appendix does not apply to you.\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"document\"},\"sidebarText\":\"Appendix 3: Additional Services\"},{\"contentTypeId\":\"CDXV2_EditorialText\",\"id\":\"xYsNWKMDSS0ivIfj7U0pJ\",\"componentId\":\"business-user-agreement-us-1-usdc-rewards\",\"body\":{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"value\":\"1. USDC Rewards\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"heading-4\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"value\":\"\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"value\":\"USDC IS NOT LEGAL TENDER. USDC IS A SUPPORTED DIGITAL ASSET AND COINBASE HAS NO RIGHT TO USE ANY USDC IN YOUR BUSINESS ACCOUNT. COINBASE IS NOT A DEPOSITORY INSTITUTION, AND YOUR USDC WALLET IS NOT A DEPOSIT ACCOUNT.  \",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"value\":\"1.1. Eligibility\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\". If you are \",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{\"uri\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fhelp.coinbase.com\u002Fen\u002Fcoinbase\u002Fgetting-started\u002Fcrypto-education\u002Fusd-coin-rewards-faq\"},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"eligible\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"hyperlink\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\", you can earn rewards for holding USDC in your Business Account. So long as you hold at least $1 of USDC in your Business Account, you will automatically earn amounts of USDC as described below in the “Calculation” section (“\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"value\":\"USDC Rewards\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"”). If at any time you do not hold at least $1 of USDC in your Business Account, your enrollment in USDC Rewards will be paused until such time that you do hold at least $1 of USDC in your Business Account. During such period you will retain all USDC Rewards previously accrued but not yet distributed. Such accrued rewards will be distributed as described below in the “Calculation” section. If at any time you are deemed \",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{\"uri\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fhelp.coinbase.com\u002Fen\u002Fcoinbase\u002Fgetting-started\u002Fcrypto-education\u002Fusd-coin-rewards-faq\"},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"ineligible\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"hyperlink\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\", your enrollment in USDC Rewards will be similarly paused. You can opt-out of, or back into, USDC Rewards at any time by following the instructions \",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{\"uri\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fhelp.coinbase.com\u002Fen\u002Fcoinbase\u002Fgetting-started\u002Fcrypto-education\u002Fusd-coin-rewards-faq\"},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"here\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"hyperlink\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\". If you opt-out of USDC Rewards or close your Business Account, you will forfeit the rewards you have accrued (that are not yet distributed for the current calendar month) up to that time.\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"value\":\"1.2. Calculation\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\". Rewards are earned on a daily basis in the form of USDC at the then current USDC Rewards Rate. Our current USDC Rewards Rate can be found \",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{\"uri\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fhelp.coinbase.com\u002Fen\u002Fcoinbase\u002Fgetting-started\u002Fcrypto-education\u002Fusd-coin-rewards-faq\"},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"here\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"hyperlink\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\". Our current USDC Rewards Annual Percentage Yield, which includes the effect of monthly compounding, can be found \",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{\"uri\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fcoinbase.com\u002Faccounts\"},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"here\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"hyperlink\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\" and \",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{\"uri\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fhelp.coinbase.com\u002Fen\u002Fcoinbase\u002Fgetting-started\u002Fcrypto-education\u002Fusd-coin-rewards-faq\"},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"here\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"hyperlink\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\". Rewards earned in a particular month are airdropped into your Coinbase USDC wallet within five (5) business days after the start of the next calendar month. USDC Rewards distributed to you are rounded-down to the nearest sixth decimal place. We use the Daily Balance Method to determine the rewards you earn for a particular day, using your average balance of USDC on that specific day as that day’s balance. The rate used to determine rewards earned for a particular day is the then current USDC Rewards Rate divided by 365.\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"value\":\"1.3. Changes\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\". We reserve the right to change the USDC Rewards Rate Annual Percentage Yield at any time by notification \",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{\"uri\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fcoinbase.com\u002Faccounts\"},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"here\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"hyperlink\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\" and \",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{\"uri\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fhelp.coinbase.com\u002Fen\u002Fcoinbase\u002Fgetting-started\u002Fcrypto-education\u002Fusd-coin-rewards-faq\"},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"here\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"hyperlink\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\" and by other reasonable means of notice (including e-mail). Unless otherwise stated in the notice, no change will be effective until the first day of the calendar month after such notice is made. We reserve the right to add, change, or delete any provision of these terms and to terminate the USDC rewards program, or your participation in the program, at any time upon notice made in the same manner.\\n\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"value\":\"1.4. Definitions\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\".\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"“\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"value\":\"USDC Rewards Rate\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"” means the annual rate of rewards earned on a USDC wallet, which does not reflect compounding. The current USDC Rewards Rate can be found \",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{\"uri\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fhelp.coinbase.com\u002Fen\u002Fcoinbase\u002Fgetting-started\u002Fcrypto-education\u002Fusd-coin-rewards-faq\"},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"here\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"hyperlink\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\".\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"“\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"value\":\"USDC Rewards Annual Percentage Yield\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"” or “\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"value\":\"APY\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"” means the percentage rate reflecting the total amount of USDC Rewards earned, based on the then current USDC Rewards Rate and end of month compounding for a 365-day period. The current USDC Rewards Annual Percentage Yield can be found \",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{\"uri\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fcoinbase.com\u002Faccounts\"},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"here\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"hyperlink\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\" and \",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{\"uri\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fhelp.coinbase.com\u002Fen\u002Fcoinbase\u002Fgetting-started\u002Fcrypto-education\u002Fusd-coin-rewards-faq\"},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"here\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"hyperlink\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\".\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"“\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"value\":\"Daily Balance Method\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"” means the application of the daily periodic rate (derived from the APY) to the calendar day average of USDC held in your USDC wallet each day.\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"document\"},\"sidebarText\":\"USDC Rewards\"},{\"contentTypeId\":\"CDXV2_EditorialText\",\"id\":\"1v6KZcNnujyzSjce4edjmw\",\"componentId\":\"business-user-agreement-us-2-staking-services\",\"body\":{\"nodeType\":\"document\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"heading-4\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"2. Staking Services\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"data\":{}}]},{\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"\",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]},{\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"When you hold Supported Digital Assets on Coinbase you may be given the option to “stake” eligible assets in a third party proof of stake network via staking services provided by Coinbase or an affiliate (including a third party validator operator). Please visit our \",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}},{\"nodeType\":\"hyperlink\",\"data\":{\"uri\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fhelp.coinbase.com\u002Fen\u002Fcoinbase\u002Ftrading-and-funding\u002Fstaking-rewards\u002Fstaking-inflation\"},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"staking information page\",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]},{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\" for further details on how proof of stake works.\",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]},{\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"1.1. Staking Services Are Optional and Do Not Affect Ownership\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"data\":{}},{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\". Staking services may be available for some or all of your Supported Digital Assets. YOU ARE NOT REQUIRED TO STAKE WITH COINBASE AND YOU \",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}},{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"CAN REQUEST TO UNSTAKE\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"underline\"}],\"data\":{}},{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\" AT ANY TIME. FOR MORE INFORMATION VISIT THE \",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}},{\"nodeType\":\"hyperlink\",\"data\":{\"uri\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fhelp.coinbase.com\u002Fen\u002Fcoinbase\u002Ftrading-and-funding\u002Fstaking-rewards\u002Fstaking-inflation#how-do-i-earn-rewards-on-coinbase?\"},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"HELP CENTER\",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]},{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\". If you choose to stake, Coinbase will perform blockchain operations involving your digital assets as described below. This instruction to stake your digital assets does not affect the ownership of your digital assets in any way. For the avoidance of doubt, the provisions for Digital Asset Custody and Title described in Section 2.7 above apply whether or not a digital asset is staked.\",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]},{\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"1.2. The Service; Rewards; Commission; Limitations\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"data\":{}},{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\". If you stake your assets with us, Coinbase, or one of its affiliates, will facilitate the staking of those assets on your behalf by acting as a transaction validator on the applicable network for the Supported Digital Asset you stake. Depending on the protocol, there may be a delay before your assets are eligible to participate in the transaction validation process and earn rewards. If Coinbase or an affiliate successfully performs a validation task in that Supported Digital Asset, you may earn a reward granted by that Supported Digital Asset’s network. Rewards are determined by the protocols of the \",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}},{\"nodeType\":\"hyperlink\",\"data\":{\"uri\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fhelp.coinbase.com\u002Fen\u002Fcoinbase\u002Ftrading-and-funding\u002Fstaking-rewards\u002Fstaking-inflation\"},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"applicable network.\",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]},{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\" If the applicable network distributes any rewards in unstaked form, Coinbase will use commercially reasonable efforts to restake those rewards. You may request to unstake your accrued rewards at any time as described in Section 1.4 below. Rewards will be credited to your account by taking into account the amount of your principal and previously accrued rewards that remain staked with Coinbase. Coinbase will credit your account for any earned rewards after receipt by Coinbase, minus a commission. The current commission for each staking asset can be found in the \",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}},{\"nodeType\":\"hyperlink\",\"data\":{\"uri\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fhelp.coinbase.com\u002Fen\u002Fcoinbase\u002Ftrading-and-funding\u002Fpricing-and-fees\u002Ffees\"},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Help Center\",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]},{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\". Coinbase may change these published commissions at any time, including after your assets have been staked. Coinbase may also offer lower commissions for certain assets on a promotional basis, and these promotional commissions may differ among Coinbase users. You will be notified if you receive a promotional commission offer.\",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]},{\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"1.3. Slashing\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"data\":{}},{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\". Some Digital Asset networks subject staked assets to “slashing” if the transaction validator representing those assets incorrectly validates a transaction. Coinbase will use commercially reasonable efforts to prevent any staked assets from slashing; however, in the event they are, Coinbase will replace your assets so long as such penalties are not a result of: (i) protocol-level failures caused by bugs, maintenance, upgrades, or general failure; (ii) your acts or omissions; (iii) acts or omissions of any third party service provider; (iv) a force majeure event as defined in Section 9.6 of the Coinbase Business User Agreement; (v) acts by a hacker or other malicious actor; or (vi) any other events outside of Coinbase’s reasonable control.\",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]},{\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"1.4. Protocol Lockups and Unstaking\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"data\":{}},{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\". Some Digital Asset networks require that a certain amount of staked assets be locked (restricted from sale or transfer) for a period of time while staking.\",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]},{\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"You will need to request for your staked assets to be unstaked before they can be sold or transferred. When you request to unstake, Coinbase will take blockchain operations on your behalf to wind-down your assets’ participation in the validation process of the relevant protocol. These blockchain operations may take up to 48 hours to complete, in addition to any applicable protocol unstaking period. Depending on the protocol, you may or may not receive staking rewards during the unstaking process. Expected unstaking periods are estimates only. We will notify you when the unstaking process is complete.\",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]},{\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"1.5. No Guarantee of Rewards\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"data\":{}},{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\". You have no right to a reward until it is received by Coinbase. Rewards will be distributed to your account promptly after they are received by Coinbase, except that Boosted Staking Rewards will be distributed in the month after they are received by Coinbase, within the first 5 business days of the month. Unless otherwise specified, the “staking rewards rate” disclosed by Coinbase for a particular Supported Digital Asset is an annualized historical rate based on the staking rewards generated by Coinbase in providing staking services to Coinbase customers for that Supported Digital Asset, minus our commission. This rate is an estimate and may change over time. COINBASE DOES NOT GUARANTEE THAT YOU WILL RECEIVE ANY STAKING REWARDS, INCLUDING THE STAKING REWARDS RATES OR BOOSTED STAKING REWARDS.\",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]},{\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"1.6. Eligibility\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"data\":{}},{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\". Users who wish to stake through Coinbase must meet certain eligibility requirements, as set forth \",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}},{\"nodeType\":\"hyperlink\",\"data\":{\"uri\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fhelp.coinbase.com\u002Fen\u002Fcoinbase\u002Ftrading-and-funding\u002Fcoinbase-earn\u002Frewards#what-are-the-eligibility-requirements-for-rewards?\"},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"here\",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]},{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\".  These requirements are subject to change. \",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]},{\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"1.7. Ethereum Staking and Wrapping\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"data\":{}},{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\". In some jurisdictions, you may choose to obtain the ability to sell, send, spend, or otherwise use your staked ETH by selecting, at your sole discretion, to wrap into a token that represents the ETH that you have staked plus associated rewards. This service is not available everywhere, and additional eligibility requirements may apply. By electing to wrap your staked ETH plus any associated rewards balance into the Coinbase Wrapped Staked ETH known as “cbETH” you understand and agree that:\",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]},{\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"(a) Once wrapped, you cannot redeem your staked ETH or claim any associated rewards except as described in Section 1.8 below.\",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]},{\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"(b) cbETH represents ownership of ETH staked with Coinbase in accordance with this Appendix (including any associated rewards and minus any Coinbase fees and slashing penalties). By wrapping staked ETH as cbETH, you remain entitled to all of the economic value, risk, and rewards of the staked ETH.  \",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]},{\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"(c) Selling or otherwise transferring cbETH automatically transfers ownership of the staked ETH and the right to redeem described in Section 1.8 below, and entitles the recipient to the attendant economic value, risk, and rewards of the staked ETH, subject to the terms of this Agreement.\",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]},{\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"(d) Staked ETH and associated rewards that have been wrapped as cbETH are held by Coinbase on behalf of holders of cbETH, and ownership of these assets shall not transfer to Coinbase. Section 2.7 of this Agreement shall apply to staked ETH and associated rewards held on behalf of cbETH holders to the same extent as staked ETH held by Coinbase on behalf of Coinbase customers.\",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]},{\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"(e) cbETH is an ERC-20 token and may be compatible with protocols or other software or technology provided by third parties. \",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]},{\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"(f) The staked ETH held by Coinbase on behalf of cbETH holders are subject to the risk of slashing described in 1.3 above. Depending on when you began staking ETH with Coinbase, you may lose certain slashing protection by wrapping your staked ETH.\",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]},{\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"In addition, you understand, agree and accept the following \",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}},{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"risks\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"italic\"}],\"data\":{}},{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\" associated with electing to wrap into cbETH:\",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]},{\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"(g) Coinbase does not guarantee the value of your staked ETH principal or associated rewards.\",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]},{\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"(h) Coinbase is not responsible for any decrease in the value of your staked ETH principal or associated rewards.\",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]},{\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"(i) The price of cbETH could diverge from the price of ETH or staked ETH because of market fluctuations, which may be affected by the actions or inactions of market makers or other market participants who receive loans or other incentives to purchase cbETH.\",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]},{\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"(j) Coinbase does not guarantee that wrapping staked ETH will result in a successful exchange or sale of cbETH, and Coinbase will not backstop or otherwise intervene to guarantee cbETH liquidity.\",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]},{\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"(k) Coinbase does not guarantee the security or functionality of any third-party protocol, software or technology intended to be compatible with cbETH and is not responsible for any losses of cbETH due to the failure of third-party protocol, software or technology.\",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]},{\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"(l) As with the protocols for other Digital Assets, Coinbase does not own or control the underlying Ethereum protocol which governs the operation of cbETH.  Accordingly, cbETH is subject to Section 2.6 of this Coinbase Business User Agreement, like other Digital Assets.\",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]},{\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"(m) As with other Digital Assets, cbETH could be impacted by one or more regulatory actions, which could impede or limit the services we can provide with respect to cbETH.\",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]},{\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"1.8. Unwrapping\u002FRedemption of cbETH\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"data\":{}}]},{\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"(a) If you hold cbETH in your Business Account and satisfy eligibility requirements, you may instruct Coinbase to “unwrap” your cbETH, thereby redeeming your cbETH for staked ETH plus any associated rewards and minus any Coinbase fees and slashing penalties. Staked ETH and any associated rewards will remain locked until you request unstaking and the protocol unstaking process is completed as described in Section 1.4 above.\",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]},{\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"(b) To unwrap cbETH, you will need to be a Coinbase customer with a Business Account in good standing and be eligible to stake ETH as described above. Additional geographic restrictions may apply, and eligibility is subject to change. Requests to unwrap cbETH may not be processed immediately. \",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]}]},\"sidebarText\":\"Staking Services\"},{\"contentTypeId\":\"CDXV2_EditorialText\",\"id\":\"3hSSWR1CDNjnmsuPzHojHT\",\"componentId\":\"business-user-agreement-us-3-advanced-trading\",\"body\":{\"nodeType\":\"document\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"heading-4\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"3. Advanced Trading \",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"data\":{}}]},{\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"\",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]},{\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"If eligible, Coinbase Business users may access an order book for various Supported Digital Asset and Fiat Currency trading pairs (each an “\",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}},{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Order Book\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"data\":{}},{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"”) on the Coinbase Site (“\",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}},{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Advanced Trading\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"data\":{}},{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"”). See your Business Account to see what Order Books are available within Advanced Trading. Coinbase does not offer Advanced Trading to customers in all jurisdictions. By accessing Advanced Trading or the Coinbase API for Advanced Trading, you accept and agree to be bound by the \",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}},{\"nodeType\":\"hyperlink\",\"data\":{\"uri\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.coinbase.com\u002Flegal\u002Ftrading_rules\"},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"Trading Rules\",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]},{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\". \",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]},{\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"1.1. Trading Fees\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"data\":{}},{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\". By placing an order on Advanced Trading, you agree to pay all applicable fees and authorize Coinbase to automatically deduct fees directly from your account. Trading Fees are set forth in the Trading Rules and are available at \",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}},{\"nodeType\":\"hyperlink\",\"data\":{\"uri\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.coinbase.com\u002Flegal\u002Ftrading_rules\"},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.coinbase.com\u002Flegal\u002Ftrading_rules\",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]},{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\". \",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]},{\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"1.2. Trading Account Use\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"data\":{}},{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\". You may not sell, lease, furnish, or otherwise permit or provide access to your Trading Account to any other entity or to any individual that is not an employee or agent of your company. You accept full responsibility for your employees' or agents' use of Advanced Trading, whether such use is directly through Coinbase or by other means, such as those facilitated through API keys, and\u002For applications which you may authorize. You understand and agree that you are responsible for any and all orders, trades, and other instructions entered into Advanced Trading including identifiers, permissions, passwords, and security codes associated with your Business Account.\",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]},{\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\"1.3. Suspension and Cancellation\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"data\":{}},{\"nodeType\":\"text\",\"value\":\". In the event that your Business Account is suspended or terminated, we will immediately cancel all open orders associated with your account, block all withdrawals and bar the placing of further orders until resolution or account cancellation.\",\"marks\":[],\"data\":{}}]}]},\"sidebarText\":\"Advanced Trading\"},{\"contentTypeId\":\"CDXV2_EditorialText\",\"id\":\"3qOeTSaDnvlolaVSRR6c3O\",\"componentId\":\"4-payment-acceptance-services\",\"body\":{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"4\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"value\":\". Payment Acceptance Services\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"heading-4\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"value\":\"\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"value\":\"Please review the following terms and conditions regarding the Payment Acceptance Services, including the “Indemnification” section of these terms.\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"value\":\"1.1. Payment Acceptance Services\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\". The Coinbase Business Payment Links service (“Payment Links”) allows you to create and share a link to request a specific amount of USDC (or other Digital Assets at Coinbase’s discretion) from a third-party payor. The Coinbase Business Invoices service (“Invoices”) allows you to generate and track invoices that may be sent to a third-party payor via the Coinbase Site (Payment Links and Invoices are collectively “Payment Acceptance Services”).\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"Third-party payors that have been sent a payment link or an invoice (collectively “Payment Acceptance Payors”) may connect a self-hosted wallet (or accounts associated with hosted wallets at Coinbase’s discretion) and send USDC to your Digital Asset Wallet. In the event that Coinbase, in its sole discretion, permits you to receive other Digital Assets via Payment Acceptance Services, the terms in this section applicable to USDC shall also apply to those Digital Assets.  \",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"value\":\"You acknowledge and agree that Coinbase is not party to any transactions conducted through the Payment Acceptance Services (“Payment Acceptance Transaction(s)”), and that Coinbase is not responsible for any goods and\u002For services that you provide to Payment Acceptance Payors. You further acknowledge and agree that, for the purposes of Payment Acceptance Transactions, Payment Acceptance Payors are not the customers of Coinbase, even if a Payment Acceptance Payor uses a Coinbase account for a Payment Acceptance Transaction.\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"value\":\"1.2. Payment Acceptance Protocol\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\". Payment Acceptance Transactions use a smart contracts protocol that enables you to receive USDC as a payment method for goods and services (the “Protocol”). The Protocol has been deployed to Base Chain, a layer-two optimistic rollup on the Ethereum Network. Coinbase may also deploy the Protocol to other blockchains from time to time at its sole discretion. Coinbase does not store any USDC on behalf of Payment Acceptance Payors for the purposes of Payment Acceptance Transactions. To make a Payment Acceptance Transaction, Payment Acceptance Payors will be required to sign and authorize onchain transactions instructing the delivery of USDC to your Digital Asset Wallet. In order to initiate a Payment Acceptance Transaction, Payment Acceptance Payors may be required to pay fees to the applicable digital asset network on which the Payment Acceptance Transaction takes place.  \",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"value\":\"You are responsible for informing your Payment Acceptance Payors of these fees and to explain to your Payment Acceptance Payors how the Protocol functions, including about any risks associated with Payment Acceptance Transactions.  \",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"value\":\"1.3. Payment Acceptance Services Use\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\".\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"value\":\" \",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"Your use of the Payment Acceptance Services are subject to Coinbase’s Prohibited Use Policy. You agree that, in connection with the Payment Acceptance Services, you will comply with all applicable laws including but not limited to export restrictions, end-user restrictions, antiterrorism laws, anti-money laundering laws, and economic sanctions, and you agree that you have adequate controls and systems in place to screen, and are fully responsible for screening transactions of Payment Acceptance Payors and all other third parties who may assist, benefit from, or provide goods or services to, or receive goods or services from, you and to ensure compliance with applicable laws. \",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"Coinbase is not responsible for ensuring the accuracy of the instructions that you or Payment Acceptance Payors provide for Payment Acceptance Transactions, and you agree that Coinbase shall not be liable in any way for losses that you or your Payment Acceptance Payors may incur as a result of errors or omissions in any Payment Acceptance Transactions. Payment Acceptance Transactions cannot be reversed once they have been broadcast to the relevant digital asset network (although they may be in a pending state, and designated accordingly, while the transaction is processed by network operators). Coinbase does not control the digital asset network(s) on which the Payment Acceptance Transactions are made in connection with the Protocol occur, and makes no guarantees that a Payment Acceptance Transaction will be confirmed by the relevant digital asset network(s). The Payment Acceptance Services are subject to the limitations of liability and warranties in the general User Agreement, and Coinbase is not liable for any losses you or your Payment Acceptance Payors may incur as a result of (a) digital asset network-level failures caused by bugs, maintenance, upgrades, or general failure; (b) your or your Payment Acceptance Payors’ acts or omissions; (c) acts or omissions of any third party service provider; (d) acts by a hacker or other malicious actor; or (e) any other events outside of Coinbase’s reasonable control. Once a Payment Acceptance Transaction is submitted to a digital asset network, the transaction will be unconfirmed and remain in a pending state for a period of time sufficient to allow confirmation of the transaction by the digital asset network. A Payment Acceptance Transaction is not complete while it is in a pending state, and such pending Payment Acceptance Transactions will reflect a pending transaction status. Coinbase is not liable for any losses you may incur as a result of issues with the relevant digital asset network (e.g., network outages or excessive network congestion) that causes any Payment Acceptance Transaction to remain in a pending state for an extended duration. \",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"},{\"data\":{},\"content\":[{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"value\":\"1.4. Indemnification\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\".\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}],\"value\":\" \",\"nodeType\":\"text\"},{\"data\":{},\"marks\":[],\"value\":\"In addition to any of your indemnification obligations arising under the User Agreement, you will indemnify and hold harmless Coinbase and its officers, directors, employees, agents, and other Coinbase entities from and against any claims, disputes, demands, liabilities, damages, losses, and costs and expenses, including, without limitation, reasonable legal and accounting fees arising out of or in any way connected with (i) your or your Payment Acceptance Payors’ access to or use of the Payment Acceptance Services or the Protocol or (ii) your or your Payment Acceptance Payors’ violation of these terms.\\n\\n\\n\",\"nodeType\":\"text\"}],\"nodeType\":\"paragraph\"}],\"nodeType\":\"document\"},\"sidebarText\":\"Payment Acceptance Services\"}],\"showSidebar\":true}}},{\"key\":\"placeholder-incentives\",\"params\":{},\"status\":\"fetched\"}]","disabledServicesFromQueryParams":"","clientConfig":{"example_parameter":{"stringMap":{"stringMap":{"hello":"world"}}},"exaas-gated-experiments":{"stringArray":{"stringArray":["t0002_61f7ee2d"]}},"malicious_crypto_assets":{"stringArray":{"stringArray":["solana-h-1b-visa"]}},"cb1_allowed_countries":{"stringArray":{"stringArray":["US","CA","AU","IE","DE","NL","BE","NO","AT","ES","FR","LU","CH","LI","SM","IT","SE","GB","PL","PT","DK","CZ","FI","SK","HU","RO","GR","LT","BG","SI","EE","HR","LV","CY","MT","JE","IM","AD","GG","GI","SG","BR"]}},"cfm_cde_contract_code_to_root_unit":{"stringMap":{"stringMap":{"ADA":"ADA","AIP":"CDEAI","AVA":"AVAX","AVE":"AAVE","BCH":"BCH","BIP":"BTC","BIT":"BTC","BNF":"BNB","C50":"COIN50","CHN":"CDECHN","CU":"CDECU","DEF":"CDEDEF","DOG":"DOGE","DOT":"DOT","ENA":"ENA","ET":"ETH","ETP":"ETH","GLD":"CDEGLD","HED":"HBAR","HYF":"HYPE","HYP":"HYPE","LC":"LTC","LNK":"LINK","MC":"CDEMC","NER":"NEAR","NGS":"CDENGS","OIL":"CDEOIL","OND":"ONDO","PAU":"PAXG","PEP":"PEPE","PT":"CDEPT","SHB":"SHIB","SLR":"CDESIL","SOL":"SOL","TEK":"CDETEK","XLM":"XLM","XRP":"XRP","ZEC":"ZEC"}}},"event_page_v2_enabled":{"boolean":true},"cfm_contract_root_unit_to_logged_out_label":{"stringMap":{"stringMap":{"CDEAI":"AI","CDECHN":"CHINA","CDECU":"COPR","CDEDEF":"DFNSE","CDEGLD":"GLD","CDEMC":"MAG7C","CDENGS":"NGS","CDEOIL":"OIL","CDEPT":"PLAT"